// The web's view of rumu's wire types.
//
// Types with a Rust counterpart are generated by ts-rs into ./generated
// (run `cargo test` after changing one); this module re-exports them so
// components keep importing from `~/lib/types`. Only the ad-hoc WebSocket
// protocol, push payloads (built with `json!` in the kernel), UI-only types
// and the tag/version constants are written by hand.

